# Paper plugin (Kotlin)

- Put domain logic in `service/` or `util/` without Bukkit imports; keep commands/listeners thin.
- Prefer injecting dependencies over `EmptyPlugin.instance`.
- Plugin and command classes used with MockBukkit must be `open`.
- Mirror test packages under `src/test/kotlin`; copy patterns from `TextUtilityTest`, `CommandBaseTest`, `EmptyPluginTest`.
